From 1a2c065fd3c8da7694fb46b7f2eb685ca80b0141 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Venkatakrishnaiah Pari <vpari@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 11:18:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] oot-dtbo: enable for nord

Add out-of-tree devicetree overlay support for the sa8797 (nord)
target. Strip the devicetree/Makefile down to the nord overlay entry
only, removing unrelated multi-platform dtb/dtbo entries, and add the
nord-ride overlay source along with its vfio device tree include and
associated dt-bindings headers (IPCC and shared memory) required for
the sa8797p platform.

Signed-off-by: Venkatakrishnaiah Pari <vpari@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 devicetree/Makefile                           |   92 +-
 devicetree/nord-ride_overlay.dtso             |   55 +
 .../oot-dt-bindings/qcom-ipcc-sa8797p.h       |  164 ++
 .../oot-dt-bindings/qcom-shmem-sa8797p.h      |   34 +
 devicetree/sa8797p-vfio.dtsi                  | 2074 +++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 2331 insertions(+), 88 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 devicetree/nord-ride_overlay.dtso
 create mode 100644 devicetree/oot-dt-bindings/qcom-ipcc-sa8797p.h
 create mode 100644 devicetree/oot-dt-bindings/qcom-shmem-sa8797p.h
 create mode 100644 devicetree/sa8797p-vfio.dtsi

